      "id": "claim_bf05fc48916a4e1fa7a069873691e631",
      "statement": "dcode is installed with the bundled installer `curl -LsSf https://langch.in/dcode | bash` and launched with the `dcode` command; optional model providers are opted in at install time via the DEEPAGENTS_CODE_EXTRAS environment variable.",
